    "detailed_description": "In &quot;Operation Dawn,&quot; players step into the shoes of a determined mother who recently lost her son, brutally killed in a tragic event at his military base. In the wake of this devastating loss, her husband is kidnapped by a ruthless terrorist group. Driven by love and a thirst for justice, she joins a secret organization dedicated to taking down these terrorists and rescuing her husband. Set in a vast open world filled with dynamic NPCs and customizable vehicles, players will navigate through treacherous environments, gather intelligence, and engage in high-stakes missions as part of the covert Operation Dawn.",
