    "short_description": "In &quot;Operation Dawn,&quot; you play as a mother who recently lost her son. Now, with her husband kidnapped by terrorists, she joins a secret organization to rescue him. Navigate an open world with dynamic NPCs and cars, and embark on high-stakes missions in the covert Operation Dawn.",
